      </h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <b>
            The index is a summary, not a rating.
          </b>
           Two teachers on the same index can need opposite support — the shape of the radar is what decides the coaching.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>
            Look for the dents.
          </b>
           Anything inside the dashed school-average outline is where this teacher trails the cohort; anything outside it is where they could mentor a colleague.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>
            Equity is a gate, not a score.
          </b>
